  "details": "If you kick a person from a public world and there's only one public instance of that world open, and if the person's home world is also set to the same public world they were kicked from, they get stuck in a loop. They keep trying to go home, but since there's only one public instance available, they are kicked again. This loop continues for one hour unless they go to the VRChat website and change their home world to something different.\n\n＜＞＜",
